Blacksite

This repository contains additions and patches for HolmesGPT:
https://github.com/HolmesGPT/holmesgpt

HolmesGPT is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The upstream license text is retained in LICENSE.

Blacksite modifications include local vLLM deployment configuration,
tool-calling checks and tests, documentation, and an output-token budget fix.
The modified upstream files are identified in patches/holmesgpt.patch and
upstream.json. All other upstream source remains in the separately obtained
HolmesGPT checkout.
